# Fixed MM2 Script UI + Broken Text Cleanup

## Main Problems Fixed

* Broken variable references (`_call31`, `_Character29`, `_call100`, `_call134`)
* Empty callbacks causing UI errors
* Repeated infinite loop errors
* Broken ESP highlight destroy logic
* UI section naming cleaned
* Better readable tab titles
* Cleaner structure for Delta/mobile executors
* Safer character loading
* Fixed noclip loop
* Fixed WalkSpeed / JumpPower references

---

```lua
--// TuzzHub MM2 Clean Version
--// UI + Text Fixed

local Players = game:GetService("Players")
local RunService = game:GetService("RunService")
local UIS = game:GetService("UserInputService")
local TweenService = game:GetService("TweenService")

local LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer
local Character = LocalPlayer.Character or LocalPlayer.CharacterAdded:Wait()
local Humanoid = Character:WaitForChild("Humanoid")
local Root = Character:WaitForChild("HumanoidRootPart")

LocalPlayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(function(char)
    Character = char
    Humanoid = char:WaitForChild("Humanoid")
    Root = char:WaitForChild("HumanoidRootPart")
end)

--// UI Library
local Library = loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thunc2hs/nebula/refs/heads/main/library"))()

local Window = Library:Window({
    Config = {
        Size = UDim2.new(0, 520, 0, 420),
        Keybind = Enum.KeyCode.LeftControl,
    },
    Title = "TuzzHub MM2",
    Theme = "Amethyst",
    Icon = 105059922903200,
    Desc = "Clean Fixed Version",
    CloseUIButton = {
        Enabled = true,
        Text = "Tuzz"
    }
})

